      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but i think it's a little too soft. it feels almost a bit too academic given how bad the situation actually is. \n\nthe score is only a 4... i feel like we're missing the mark on the urgency side of things. i know i said not to be hysterical, but we really need to drive home how significant this is. could you try another version where the impact feels a bit more pressing? aim for a higher score on that metric, but just... try to keep it sounding like a serious non-profit and not a tabloid. thanks.",
